name: ['City of Brass', 'Crusade', 'Elvish Champion', 'Elvish Lyrist', 'Giant Growth', 'Glorious Anthem', 'Lord of Atlantis', 'Mad Auntie', 'Royal Assassin', 'Sakura-Tribe Elder', 'Serra Avatar', 'Shard Phoenix', 'Slith Firewalker', 'Soltari Priest', 'Thran Quarry', 'Two-Headed Dragon', 'Volcanic Hammer', 'Whirling Dervish']
